WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.050
- [Narrator] Instagram is
blowing with black looking food

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.860
and beauty products.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.680
Thanks to this stuff.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:11.410
It's called activated
charcoal or activated carbon.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.210
It's what health trend fanatics
claim to be using to detox,

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.070
brighten skin and whiten their teeth.

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.190
But of course just because
you can wash with it, eat it,

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.750
and brush your teeth with it,

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.677
doesn't mean you necessary should.

00:00:25.677 --> 00:00:28.344
(curious music)

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:32.550
The global market for
activated charcoal is projected

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.593
to reach 6.2 billion dollars by 2022.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:40.180
It's an impressive feat
considering it comes from

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.680
the same stuff as your grilling charcoal.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.416
It's a da-da-da-da, burnt wood.

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:49.160
The difference is that
activated charcoal is burned

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.390
at a higher temperature so it breaks down

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:55.470
into a very fine powder which
gives it a larger surface area

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:58.460
than a chunk of charcoal on your grill.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.480
And it's exactly what you want
when you're trying to remove

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:04.170
toxins or poison from your body.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:07.400
How it works has to d with
the microscopic structure

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.289
of the charcoal itself.

00:01:09.289 --> 00:01:12.570
Inside each particle are millions of pores

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.740
that act like a tiny trap.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.510
So if you swallow some
then it will begin to bind

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.010
with other substances in your gut.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:23.167
Which is helpful if you've
just overdosed on drugs

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:26.640
since it can prevent them
from entering your system.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.870
And in fact, this is exactly
what hospitals will use

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:32.827
to treat certain cases of
poisoning before resorting

00:01:32.827 --> 00:01:34.698
to pumping the stomach.

00:01:34.698 --> 00:01:39.160
But, drugs aren't the only
thing that charcoal binds to.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:42.090
It can also soak up helpful
things like minerals,

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.540
vitamins, and antioxidants.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.940
So when you drink a
charcoal laced lemonade

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:50.760
with a healthy meal, you'll
actually absorbing less

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.700
nutrients than you otherwise would.

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.080
To make matters worse, it
can also prevent medications

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.830
like anti-depressants
and contraceptive pills

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:01.370
from reaching your system.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.350
Which of course makes them less effective.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.490
The key to activated charcoal
whether it's saving a life

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:11.458
or depriving you of nutrition, is timing.

00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:14.260
It only works if there's
something for it to absorb

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:15.640
in the first place.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:18.530
So bad news, taking charcoal
pills in the morning

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:22.260
for a hangover, it's not
gonna do anything, pal.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:26.510
Because the alcohol is long
gone from your stomach by then.

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:29.430
So ingesting charcoal for any
other reason than treating

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:33.330
a severe case of poisoning
isn't a good idea.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.970
It's indigestible.

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.970
So after you eat it,
your body passes it along

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:39.914
and eventually out the other end.

00:02:39.914 --> 00:02:42.610
Along the way, it can have side effects.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:43.443
Oh, fun.

00:02:43.443 --> 00:02:45.390
Like constipation and nausea.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.660
Not to mention there is,
sorry, no evidence to support

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.346
the claims from charcoal
enthusiasts that it will

00:02:52.346 --> 00:02:55.210
prevent bloating, boost energy,

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:57.990
brightens skin or whiten teeth.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.698
So hey, if you don't like
the idea of eating black

00:03:00.698 --> 00:03:04.030
you know, anything, you don't have to.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:06.053
Your body's probably better off anyway.

00:03:07.179 --> 00:03:09.929
(curious music)

